@gateway = https://your-apim.azure-api.net
@accessToken = replace-with-delegated-user-token
@subscriptionKey = replace-with-inference-product-key

### Non-streaming Chat. Identity and budgets follow the validated user.
POST {{gateway}}/foundry/chat/completions
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Ocp-Apim-Subscription-Key: {{subscriptionKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"model":"sample-model","messages":[{"role":"user","content":"Say hello."}],"max_completion_tokens":100}

### Streaming Chat. The gateway also forces final provider usage.
POST {{gateway}}/foundry/chat/completions
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Ocp-Apim-Subscription-Key: {{subscriptionKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"model":"sample-model","messages":[{"role":"user","content":"Say hello."}],"max_completion_tokens":100,"stream":true,"stream_options":{"include_usage":true}}

### Responses
POST {{gateway}}/foundry/responses
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Ocp-Apim-Subscription-Key: {{subscriptionKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"model":"sample-model","input":"Say hello.","max_output_tokens":100,"stream":true}
